# Add a feature

Use the plug-in registry. Do not add routes by editing `App.tsx` or `roles/catalog.ts`.

```bash
pnpm new:feature my-thing --audience=individual,family --nav
```

A module is `apps/desktop/src/features/modules/<id>/index.ts` exporting `feature: StudioFeature`. Settings tabs still go through `settings-tabs.ts`. API types stay in `packages/shared`.
